{
  "name": "La Belle Lucie",
  "description": "**Goal:** build all four foundations up from Ace to King, each in a single suit.\n\n- The board is **eighteen fans**. Build them **down in the same suit** (e.g. a ♥6 on a ♥7), **one card at a time** — only the exposed end card of a fan can move.\n- An **emptied fan stays empty**: once a fan is cleared, nothing can be placed back into it.\n- **Stuck? Tap the stock** to gather every fan, shuffle, and re-deal into threes. You may re-deal **twice per game**.\n- **Merci:** to free a card buried in a fan, turn on **FISH** (press **F**) and drag that card out — it will play wherever it legally lands. By tradition, once per game.",
  "decks": [{}],
  "rules": {
    "tableau": {
      "single": true,
      "seedNone": true,
      "build": { "direction": "Down" },
      "suit": "Same"
    }
  },
